472:// stay available to their consumers) belongs to STEP 4. It is a claim about
473:// what Step 4 does with the labels. What this package owes it â€” that every
474:// section carries the correct content_class â€” is established by
475:// TestAC01_StandardPaper and TestRoleTableMatchesTable.
