483:// inherit_test.go. It lives in its own file rather than here because four of
484:// its five clauses are about what inheritance must NOT do, and a rule is only
485:// worth having if its limits are tested as carefully as its effect.
486://
487:// AC-16 (2.3 child consensus, with its five limits) IS TESTED, in
488:// consensus_test.go, for the same reason. Seven of its eight tests describe
489:// cases where the rule must decline to fire.
490://
