342:  <precondition>PostgreSQL is running and migrated: `make up` succeeds, `EPISTEMIC_OS_DB_URL` is exported as `postgres://epistemicos:epistemicos@localhost:5432/epistemicos?sslmode=disable`, and `make migrate` exits 0 â€” without a live database none of the three claims in this task is decidable and execution must halt rather than record an unverified pass.</precondition>
