345:    - Makefile (lines 18-23 and 47-48 â€” the up and migrate targets and the readiness wait, so the precondition is satisfied the same way CI does it)
346:    - internal/adapters/secondary/store/segmentation_test.go (the fixture-round-trip test â€” the only test that exercises either fixture path, the relative path it resolves, and the fact that the read happens after the pool is obtained)
347:    - internal/platform/testenv/testenv.go (the fixture branch, to confirm the observed message comes from the escalated path and to read the unescalated skip text)
